Uh, well, it wasn't nearly as
pretty as you are, of course.

93
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:41,677
But we saw something fall into
the old ruins with the Tentomon.

94
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:44,357
So when were you planning
on telling us next week?

95
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,477
They must have seen Izzy, too, Belmont.

96
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,057
Listen, you two, can you take us there?

97
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:49,577
It's important that we find him.

98
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:50,657
Sure, okie-dokie.

99
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:51,799
No funny business.

100
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,220
Cross our hearts.

101
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,300
And hope to die.

102
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:57,617
We'll have all the absolutely
ridiculous things to say.

103
