Right over there.

104
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,310
Huh?

105
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:03,370
Huh?

106
00:06:03,453 --> 00:06:05,500
Oh, well, that's great. Just great.

107
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,597
How are we supposed to get over there?

108
