Oh, maybe we jump the gun.

116
00:06:33,100 --> 00:06:33,930
Ugh!

117
00:06:34,013 --> 00:06:36,177
Just the thought of that
kiss is making me queasy.

118
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:37,090
That's okay.

119
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:38,617
We'll wait till you come back.

120
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:40,053
Don't hold your breath.

121
