Look, it's one of Devamon's black gears.

125
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:55,680
So it is.

126
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,017
You know what I think?

127
00:06:57,100 --> 00:07:00,317
If we keep this gear from turning,
we'll completely jam that creep up.

128
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:02,900
Or even better, we could not do that.

129
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,217
Wouldn't that be fun?

130
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:08,597
