we saw the last time.

133
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:12,470
Remember?

134
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:17,747
It made me realize that in DigiWorld,
basic data is a living, viable substance.

135
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:20,940
All that data is stored on my hard drive.

136
